.TH SYS_PROC_ENVIRON 2 "March 2026" "Substrate" "System Calls Manual"
.SH NAME
sys_proc_environ \- query process environment vector
.SH LIBRARY
System library (libsys, \-lsys)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/sysinfo.h>
.PP
.BI "int sys_proc_environ(pid_t " pid ", char **" envp ", size_t *" envc ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR sys_proc_environ ()
attempts to retrieve environment data for process
.IR pid .
The API is designed to return an environment pointer array and element count.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, 0 is returned.
On error, a negative value is returned by the current implementation.
.SH ERRORS
.TP
.B ENOSYS
Current kernel implementation is a stub.
.SH NOTES
Wired in native dispatch, currently unimplemented in kernel.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR execve (2),
.BR sys_proc_cmdline (2),
.BR sys_proc_info (2)
